=20
Based on a na=EFve look, I'd suggest putting copies of prcm_irq_handler()=
=20
into each of the omap*_prm.c files, calling local static functions for=20
read_pending_events() and save_and_disable_irqenable_bits(), and then=20
calling into common code in omap_prm_common.c for the rest of the=20
function.  Looks like omap_prm_complete() would also need=20
PRM-variant-specific copies.  I guess most of the rest could be common=20
code?

